    "excerpt": "Find the best accessible hotels in Bangkok for seniors in 2026. Detailed guide to wheelchair-friendly luxury hotels including Siam Kempinski, Shangri-La, Mandarin Oriental, Anantara Riverside, and Chatrium Riverside — with roll-in showers, grab bars, elevator access, and BTS proximity.",
