    "title": "Best Instagram-Worthy Family Photo Spots in Bali 2026",
    "excerpt": "15 stunning Bali photo spots that work for families. Rice terraces, temples, waterfalls & beach locations with safety tips, best times, and nearby family-friendly hotels.",
    "date": "May 18, 2026",
    "author": "Family Travel Asia Team",
    "tags": [
      "bali",
      "family-photography",
      "photo-spots",
      "instagram-worthy",
      "bali-attractions",
      "family-travel"
    ],
    "readingTime": "12 min read",
