    "title": "Best Family Hotels in Tokyo with Kids' Clubs (2026 Guide)",
    "excerpt": "From Shinjuku to Odaiba — Tokyo's best family hotels with dedicated kids' clubs, family suites, and activities that give parents a real break. Price comparisons for families of four.",
