    "excerpt": "The best luxury family hotels in Singapore near Marina Bay and Sentosa — Marina Bay Sands, Fullerton Bay, Raffles Hotel, Capella Singapore, W Sentosa, and Shangri-La Rasa Sentosa — tested for family suites, connecting rooms, pools, and kid-friendly amenities.",
    "date": "2026-05-19",
