    "slug": "bali-best-family-hotels-resorts-2026",
    "title": "10 Best Family-Friendly Hotels in Bali 2026: Kids Clubs, Pools & Value",
    "excerpt": "The ultimate guide to Bali best family hotels and resorts for 2026. From beachfront Nusa Dua to Ubud jungle retreats — with kids clubs, water parks, babysitting, and real price comparisons for a family of four.",
    "date": "2026-05-14",
